    + (oil)
{pork and onion} = (pork meat) + (onion)
    <fry, in (frying pan), medium-high heat, 10-15m>
Meanwhile [
    (carrot) <cut, into small pieces>
    (parsley) <chop>
]
{pork and onion} + (water) + (tomato paste) + (buckwheat) + (carrot)
