    {pork and onion} + (chili powder)
]
{mixture} <mix, thoroughly>
    + (garlic) + (bay leaves) + (parsley)
Once the water boils:
(frying pan) <cover, with (lid)>
{mixture} <stew, low heat, ~25m>
    <serve, hot>
